### TEST 4.1: Get Order Detail - Valid Order ID
# Expected: 200 OK, detail lengkap order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

# ✅ Assertions:
# - Status: 200
# - Response has order object dengan:
#   - order_number
#   - order_status
#   - payment_method
#   - delivery_method
#   - items array (product name, qty, price)
#   - payment object (status, bank_name)
#   - total_price, discount, final_price

###

