###############################################
# 🧪 TEST GROUP 7: STOCK MANAGEMENT
###############################################

### TEST 7.1: Stock Deduction - After Checkout
# Expected: Stock berkurang sesuai quantity
# MANUAL TEST:
# 1. Cek stock produk A (misal: 100)
# 2. Checkout produk A quantity 5
# 3. Cek stock produk A lagi
# 4. Verify: stock = 95 (100 - 5)

###

### TEST 7.2: Stock Return - After Order Cancelled
# Expected: Stock kembali setelah cancel
# MANUAL TEST:
# 1. Stock produk B: 50
# 2. Checkout produk B qty 10 (stock jadi 40)
# 3. Wait 10 minutes (auto cancel)
# 4. Verify: stock kembali 50

###

### TEST 7.3: Stock Movement Log - Recorded
# Expected: Setiap perubahan stock tercatat di stock_movements table
# MANUAL CHECK di database:
# SELECT * FROM stock_movements WHERE product_id = '...'
# Verify ada record: type='OUT', quantity=-5, reference_type='ORDER'

###

